# Normalize line endings — the team is on mixed Windows/Linux machines
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary

# The committed art pack (assets/). `text=auto` above only *guesses* at binary
# content, and a wrong guess rewrites bytes inside a sprite sheet. Every binary
# format the pack ships is named here so nothing is left to the heuristic.
*.gif binary
*.ase binary
*.aseprite binary
*.zip binary
